  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Comedian — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>You have learned to channel reverse cursed energy into your technique to create your reversal! Instead of bringing your humor into reality, you play the straight man and force people into reality. As an action for 2 CE, you activate your technique for 1 minute while maintaining concentration.  While  your  technique  is  active,  you  and  a  number  of creatures  of  your  choice  up  to  your  CE  modifier  within  20  ft  are immune to the frightened or charmed condition. While your reversal is active, you cannot use Comedy.</p>",
